0", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_553200997840163_8421225844214804779_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Upxjoqvb328Q7kNvwG6Lf4z&_nc_oc=Adq5_m0efJuGR2Wf4WMp6YGUzzXmld0vTloYtm2HV0JeUCtriJgr9LRSRofTDuKyFAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVQfYSdyR99GQdKXK7WeEAAF3O7VM-Xz9ceeJKCqnUA-w&oe=6B0F02DB"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_redlight.png", "id": "885485973918344", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307470_885485977251677_236459379275901057_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BRwBkp6WBPwQ7kNvwFhBCVG&_nc_oc=AdqRNI0khE2LH5mxdPuBxlSG94NkWxeY4p8teXyilDC_Fwg6FHY0B9lExeub453jzYg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVKm8Aix9XhcREQbD0xpxQ-VNConvaAMlQocOkJMC4rOw&oe=6B0F1841"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_treasurechest.png", "id": "1554385379036074", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300619_1554385382369407_6649834865537826538_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vwKeHEflgVoQ7kNvwFueGGY&_nc_oc=Adq-YqiiZPuB4lBlO7FDi5wAsGMXyxb9KHZkWhGb1HzjGDnznMhSLufLFqAQfSCuOBw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWj5TZFJM8ryLDQNRcSkEOdw7aXh1qRQimJM9KJ5-73rQ&oe=6B0EF431"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots_2560x1440_DD_rouletteGun.png", "id": "861787259535773", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304162_861787262869106_4083471127808216396_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hK0K2a-IBewQ7kNvwFzsFoW&_nc_oc=AdoJ7K9veqczD0QvjNmZKcEY1sFaA3QnpfYvntc4WqVn80ambYRyCQQCBDcSZ46oVY0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXz5AQEaoKcN48R7P9XbAHPaxo_2QBrGKUs6qUQOFQ6Ww&oe=6B0F05C3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape_2560x1440_DD_09_monk2.png", "id": "2384792012260236", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_2384792015593569_1803606841022239710_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nXjXxDtQEGcQ7kNvwE828mg&_nc_oc=Adqd6Cjh54lmHCKcIatG_q4oxUsBGONN6TbrsQc9TibaRen7tLZmhXL_EVOBfzTpC04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWHzxFO2YYrhxgS_BGuv2xvIgiG4q4axSA-xT-qAcxNrA&oe=6B0F1162"}, "display_name": "Deadly Delivery", "keywords": ["Multiplayer", "Horror", "Company", "lethal", "coop"], "long_description": "BOO! New scary UPDATE out now! \nIn Deadly Delivery, you and your fellow delivery goblins are tasked with delivering parcels into pitch-black mines full of... things. \nArmed with questionable equipment, you'll sneak, sprint, and scream your way through procedurally generated tunnels.\n{9656622597769756}\n\nJoin our discord to be part of the community and find other goblins to play with! discord.gg/vxaFQr9jqC\n\n\n\n# Features\n# \ud83d\udc80 Deadly Co-op Missions\n Team up with up to 3 other players in online co-op. Coordinate, deliver, and survive, or watch your coworkers get picked off one by one.\n{671974505659765}\n\n# \ud83d\udd26 Physics based VR Horror\n Built for VR with a physics based world, spatial audio, and proximity voice chat. \nHaul a variety of parcels, climb on other players or give them a slap of encouragement \n{4124201431128214}\n\n# \ud83d\udc79 Monsters With Personality\n Face off against terrifying entities, some may even look and act like your teammates. Learn their patterns, or feed them your friends.\n\n# \u26f0\ufe0f Progression\nLevel up, upgrade your gear, grab a pet, unlock cosmetics!\n", "short_description": "An online VR co-op horror game about delivering parcels into haunted mines. \nAvoid monsters, drop off packages, and pray you reach the quota! \nTeam up with up to 3 other delivery goblins, survive your shift and pay back your student loans."}]}, "developer_name": "Flat Head Studio", "develo